# The Vercel project builds apps/web only (Root Directory = apps/web). Upload nothing else: the repo root holds
# data/ (the local database and downloaded reports), .env files and the Python code, none of which Vercel needs.
# Allowlist: ignore everything, then bring back the web app without its local build output and secrets.
/*
!/apps
/apps/*
!/apps/web
/apps/web/node_modules
/apps/web/.next
/apps/web/.env*
/apps/web/.vercel
/apps/web/test-results
/apps/web/playwright-report
/apps/web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
